{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49323","headline":"清平乐 六 · 韦庄","name":"清平乐 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绿杨春雨，金线飘千缕。\n花拆香枝黄鹂语，玉勒雕鞍何处。\n碧窗望断燕鸿，翠帘睡眼溟蒙。\n宝瑟谁家弹罢，含悲斜倚屏风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49323.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49323","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}